        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These efforts are designed to strengthen connections among our associates, our customers, and the communities in which we operate, consistent with our business objectives and applicable laws.",
        "start_character": 19190,
        "end_character": 19381
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also expanded leadership academy offerings to not only our field district managers but to our supply chain, field and Store Support Center directors.",
        "start_character": 18173,
        "end_character": 18325
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to providing market-competitive pay for all positions, and we are a pay-for-performance organization, offering performance-based compensation opportunities at nearly all levels of the organization, including certain hourly-paid positions.",
        "start_character": 15722,
        "end_character": 15977
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in the value retail sector, which is currently and in the future expected to continue to be highly competitive with respect to price, store location, merchandise quality, product assortment and presentation, shopping experience, and customer service, including merchandise delivery and checkout options.",
        "start_character": 12548,
        "end_character": 12862
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We strive to exceed our customers’ expectations for product variety and quality by offering items we believe typically sell for higher prices elsewhere, and we believe our mix of imported and domestic merchandise is critical to this end.",
        "start_character": 9190,
        "end_character": 9427
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we launched formal high potential director and vice president leadership development programs to build our internal talent pipeline to support our future growth.",
        "start_character": 18326,
        "end_character": 18501
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In our Dollar Tree Canada stores, we generally sell items for $1.75 (CAD) or less.",
        "start_character": 7668,
        "end_character": 7750
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To support this objective, we provide a multitude of professional and leadership development experiences, including online and instructor-led trainings, tuition reimbursement for graduate, undergraduate, General Educational Development (“GED”) and English as a Second Language classes, and discounted tuition at hundreds of colleges and universities for our associates and their families.",
        "start_character": 17190,
        "end_character": 17578
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We actively invest in our associates through training, leadership development, and internal advancement opportunities, with a focus on building operational capability and reducing turnover.",
        "start_character": 2990,
        "end_character": 3179
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are the owners of several trademarks including “Dollar Tree,” the “Dollar Tree” logo, and other names and designs of certain merchandise sold in our stores.",
        "start_character": 14330,
        "end_character": 14489
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
        "accession_number": "0000935703-26-000025",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe in the growth and development of our associates and are committed to building a culture of learning that gives associates the opportunity to enhance their skills at every stage of their career.",
        "start_character": 16985,
        "end_character": 17189
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000935703-26-000025",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000935703-26-000025-227c27e00d965384",
